KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Use of English (Year 2024)

Q1. Select the option that best explains: 'The candidate threw in the towel after early ballots.'
  (A) Surrendered and conceded defeat
  (B) Took a shower
  (C) Protested aggressively
  (D) Celebrated
  Answer: A - 'To throw in the towel' means to surrender or admit defeat.


